c evaluator for equation words before\nthe support list is specialized to a row.\n","docLink":"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.lift_genVar_list_prod_val","kind":"theorem","line":557,"name":"SolutionGroup.lift_genVar_list_prod_val","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.lean#L557-L580"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.eqSupport_toLinearSystem\"><span class=\"name\">SolutionGroup</span>.<span class=\"name\">eqSupport_toLinearSystem</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">G</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout\">LCSLayout</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">game</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSGame\">LCSGame</a> <span class=\"fn\">G</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.r\">r</a></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#eqSupport\">eqSupport</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">game</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSGame.toLinearSystem\">toLinearSystem</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.V\">V</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The linear-system support of equation $i$ is the game row support $V_i$:\n$$\n  \\operatorname{eqSupport}(\\operatorname{game.toLinearSystem}, i) = V_i.\n$$\nThis rewrite aligns the generic `equationWord` construction with the LCS row\nsupport used in observable products.\n","docLink":"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.eqSupport_toLinearSystem","kind":"theorem","line":544,"name":"SolutionGroup.eqSupport_toLinearSystem","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.lean#L544-L555"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.sameEquation_toLinearSystem_iff\"><span class=\"name\">SolutionGroup</span>.<span class=\"name\">sameEquation_toLinearSystem_iff</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">G</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout\">LCSLayout</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">game</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSGame\">LCSGame</a> <span class=\"fn\">G</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">j </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.s\">s</a></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#sameEquation\">sameEquation</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">game</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSGame.toLinearSystem\">toLinearSystem</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#Iff\">↔</a> <span class=\"fn\">∃ (<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.r\">r</a></span></span>), <span class=\"fn\">j</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Membership.mem\">∈</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.V\">V</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Membership.mem\">∈</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.V\">V</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"In `game.toLinearSystem`, `sameEquation` is exactly common row membership:\n$$\n  \\operatorname{sameEquation}(j,k)\n    \\Longleftrightarrow \\exists i,\\; j \\in V_i \\land k \\in V_i.\n$$\nThis converts the generic presentation's commutation hypothesis into the\nrow-wise commutation data carried by an LCS observable strategy.\n","docLink":"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.sameEquation_toLinearSystem_iff","kind":"theorem","line":530,"name":"SolutionGroup.sameEquation_toLinearSystem_iff","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.lean#L530-L542"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.rowObservableProduct_eq_noncommProd\"><span class=\"name\">SolutionGroup</span>.<span class=\"name\">rowObservableProduct_eq_noncommProd</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">G</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout\">LCSLayout</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.h