n>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRepresentationOfRelatorProof\">solutionGroupRepresentationOfRelatorProof</a> <span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span> <span class=\"fn\">hrel</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#SolutionGroup.var\">var</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.observableMatrixUnit\">observableMatrixUnit</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">⋯</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The representation built from a relator proof sends `var j` to the observable unit:\n$$\n  \\rho(x_j) = \\operatorname{obs}_j.\n$$\nThis is the public simp rule that records that the presented-group quotient did\nnot change the intended generator image.\n","docLink":"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRepresentationOfRelatorProof_var","kind":"theorem","line":379,"name":"SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRepresentationOfRelatorProof_var","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.lean#L379-L397"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">noncomputable def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRepresentationOfEquationProof\"><span class=\"name\">SolutionGroup</span>.<span class=\"name\">solutionGroupRepresentationOfEquationProof</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">S</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem\">LinearSystem</a>}</span></span>\n</span><spa