e.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">S</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem.layout\">layout</a></span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.s\">s</a></span></span>}, <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#sameEquation\">sameEquation</a> <span class=\"fn\">S</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Commute/Defs.html#Commute\">Commute</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>)</span></span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hequation</span> :\n  <span class=\"fn\">∀ (<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">S</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem.layout\">layout</a></span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.r\">r</a></span></span>),\n    <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Mathlib/GroupTheory/FreeGroup/Basic.html#FreeGroup.lift\">FreeGroup.lift</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage\">solutionGroupGeneratorImage</a> <span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span>)</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#equationRelator\">equationRelator</a> <span class=\"fn\">S</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#SolutionGroup\">SolutionGroup</a> <span class=\"fn\">S</span></span> <a href=\"./Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Hom/Defs.html#MonoidHom\">→*</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix\">Matrix</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Complex/Basic.html#Complex\">ℂ</a>)</span><a href=\"./Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Units/Defs.html#Units\">ˣ</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Construct a representation once the equation relators are known.\n\nThis is the main generic constructor used by later sections.  It packages the\ntwo lower-level steps:\n\n```text\nhsame + hequation\n  ↓ solutionGroupRelatorProofOfEquationProof\nall relators map to 1\n  ↓ solutionGroupRepresentationOfRelatorProof\nSolutionGroup S →* (Matrix n n ℂ)ˣ\n```\n\nThe call to `solutionGroupRelatorProofOfEquationProof` also inserts two routine\nfacts: `-I` commutes with every matrix unit, and matrix-level commutation of\nobservables lifts to commutation of the corresponding units.\n","docLink":"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRepresentationOfEquationProof","kind":"def","line":344,"name":"SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRepresentationOfEquationProof","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.lean#L344-L377"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.commute_negOneMatrixUnit\"><span class=\"name\">SolutionGroup</span>.<span class=\"name\">commute_negOneMatrixUnit</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Defs.html#Fintype\">Fintype</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#DecidableEq\">DecidableEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">U</span> : <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix\">Matrix</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Complex/Basic.html#Complex\">ℂ</a>)</span><a href=\"./Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Units/Defs.html#Units\">ˣ</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Commute/Defs.html#Commute\">Commute</a> <span class=\"fn\">U</span> <a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.negOneMatrixUnit\">negOneMatrixUnit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The distinguished image of $J$, namely $-I$, commutes with every matrix unit:\n$$\n  U(-I) = (-I)U.\n$$\nThis proves the centrality relators involving $J$ in the target unit group.\n","docLink":"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.commute_negOneMatrixUnit","kind":"theorem","line":332,"name":"SolutionGroup.commute_negOneMatrixUnit","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.lean#L332-L342"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.observableMatrixUnit_commute_of_commute\"><span class=\"name\">SolutionGroup</span>.<span class=\"name\">observableMatrixUnit_commute_of_commute</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Defs.html#Fintype\">Fintype</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#DecidableEq\">DecidableEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">M </span><span class=\"fn\">N</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix\">Matrix</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Complex/Basic.html#Complex\">ℂ</a></span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">hM</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Observable.html#IsObservable\">IsObservable</a> <span class=\"fn\">M</span></span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">hN</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Observable.html#IsObservable\">IsObservable</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span></span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Commute/Defs.html#Commute\">Commute</a> <span class=\"fn\">M</span> <span class=\"fn\">N</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Commute/Defs.html#Commute\">Commute</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.observableMatrixUnit\">observableMatrixUnit</a> <span class=\"fn\">M</span> <span class=\"fn\">hM</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.observableMatrixUnit\">observableMatrixUnit</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span> <span class=\"fn\">hN</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Commuting matrices give commuting observable matrix units:\n$$\n  MN = NM \\Longrightarrow \\widehat M\\,\\widehat N = \\widehat N\\,\\widehat M.\n$$\nThis lifts same-equation commutation from matrices to units, which is the form\nrequired by the relators in `SolutionGroup S`.\n","docLink":"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.observableMatrixUnit_commute_of_commute","kind":"theorem","line":318,"name":"SolutionGroup.observableMatrixUnit_commute_of_commute","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.lean#L318-L330"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRelatorProofOfEquationProof\"><span class=\"name\">SolutionGroup</span>.<span class=\"name\">solutionGroupRelatorProofOfEquationProof</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">S</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem\">LinearSystem</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Defs.html#Fintype\">Fintype</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#DecidableEq\">DecidableEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">S</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem.layout\">layout</a></span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.s\">s</a></span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix\">Matrix</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Complex/Basic.html#Complex\">ℂ</a></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span> : <span class=\"fn\">∀ (<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">S</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem.layout\">layout</a></span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.s\">s</a></span></span>), <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Observable.html#IsObservable\">IsObservable</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>)</span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hJcomm</span> :\n  <span class=\"fn\">∀ (<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">S</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem.layout\">layout</a></span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.s\">s</a></span></span>),\n    <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Commute/Defs.html#Commute\">Commute</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage\">solutionGroupGeneratorImage</a> <span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#SolutionGen.var\">SolutionGen.var</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>)</span>)</span>\n      <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage\">solutionGroupGeneratorImage</a> <span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span> <a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#SolutionGen.J\">SolutionGen.J</a>)</span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hsame</span> :\n  <span class=\"fn\">∀ {<span class=\"fn\">j </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">S</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem.layout\">layout</a></span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.s\">s</a></span></span>},\n    <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#sameEquation\">sameEquation</a> <span class=\"fn\">S</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span> →\n      <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Commute/Defs.html#Commute\">Commute</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage\">solutionGroupGeneratorImage</a> <span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#SolutionGen.var\">SolutionGen.var</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>)</span>)</span>\n        <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage\">solutionGroupGeneratorImage</a> <span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#SolutionGen.var\">SolutionGen.var</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>)</span>)</span></span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hequation</span> :\n  <span class=\"fn\">∀ (<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">S</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem.layout\">layout</a></span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.r\">r</a></span></span>),\n    <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Mathlib/GroupTheory/FreeGroup/Basic.html#FreeGroup.lift\">FreeGroup.lift</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage\">solutionGroupGeneratorImage</a> <span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span>)</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#equationRelator\">equationRelator</a> <span class=\"fn\">S</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">r</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/GroupTheory/FreeGroup/Basic.html#FreeGroup\">FreeGroup</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#SolutionGen\">SolutionGen</a> <span class=\"fn\">S</span>)</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">r</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Membership.mem\">∈</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#solutionRelators\">solutionRelators</a> <span class=\"fn\">S</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Mathlib/GroupTheory/FreeGroup/Basic.html#FreeGroup.lift\">FreeGroup.lift</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage\">solutionGroupGeneratorImage</a> <span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span>)</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">r</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Build the full relator proof from the natural structured assumptions:\n$$\n  r \\in R_S \\Longrightarrow \\operatorname{lift}(\\rho_0)(r) = 1.\n$$\nThe solution-group presentation has five families of relators: $x_j^2 = 1$,\n$J^2 = 1$, $x_jJ = Jx_j$, same-equation commutation $x_jx_k = x_kx_j$, and\nthe equation relators.  This lemma proves the first two from observability and\n$J \\mapsto -I$, consumes `hJcomm` and `hsame` for the commutation relators, and\nuses `hequation` for the row equations.  It is the structured all-relators proof\nneeded before applying the presented-group universal property.\n","docLink":"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRelatorProofOfEquationProof","kind":"theorem","line":271,"name":"SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRelatorProofOfEquationProof","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.lean#L271-L316"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">noncomputable def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRepresentationOfRelatorProof\"><span class=\"name\">SolutionGroup</span>.<span class=\"name\">solutionGroupRepresentationOfRelatorProof</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">S</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem\">LinearSystem</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Defs.html#Fintype\">Fintype</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#DecidableEq\">DecidableEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">S</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem.layout\">layout</a></span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.s\">s</a></span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix\">Matrix</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Complex/Basic.html#Complex\">ℂ</a></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span> : <span class=\"fn\">∀ (<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">S</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem.layout\">layout</a></span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.s\">s</a></span></span>), <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Observable.html#IsObservable\">IsObservable</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>)</span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hrel</span> : <span class=\"fn\">∀ <span class=\"fn\">r</span> ∈ <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#solutionRelators\">solutionRelators</a> <span class=\"fn\">S</span></span>, <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Mathlib/GroupTheory/FreeGroup/Basic.html#FreeGroup.lift\">FreeGroup.lift</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage\">solutionGroupGeneratorImage</a> <span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span>)</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">r</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#SolutionGroup\">SolutionGroup</a> <span class=\"fn\">S</span></span> <a href=\"./Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Hom/Defs.html#MonoidHom\">→*</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix\">Matrix</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Complex/Basic.html#Complex\">ℂ</a>)</span><a href=\"./Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Units/Defs.html#Units\">ˣ</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The raw universal-property constructor for solution-group representations.\n\nThe input `hrel` says that every defining relator of `SolutionGroup S` maps to\n`1` under the free-group lift of `solutionGroupGeneratorImage`.  With that\nproof in hand, `PresentedGroup.toGroup` descends the generator assignment to a\ngroup homomorphism\n\n```lean\nSolutionGroup S →* (Matrix n n ℂ)ˣ\n```\n\nThis definition does not prove any relators itself; it only consumes the full\nrelator proof.\n","docLink":"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRepresentationOfRelatorProof","kind":"def","line":248,"name":"SolutionGroup.solutionGroupRepresentationOfRelatorProof","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.lean#L248-L269"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage_J\"><span class=\"name\">SolutionGroup</span>.<span class=\"name\">solutionGroupGeneratorImage_J</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">S</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem\">LinearSystem</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Defs.html#Fintype\">Fintype</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#DecidableEq\">DecidableEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">S</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem.layout\">layout</a></span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.s\">s</a></span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix\">Matrix</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Complex/Basic.html#Complex\">ℂ</a></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span> : <span class=\"fn\">∀ (<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">S</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem.layout\">layout</a></span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.s\">s</a></span></span>), <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Observable.html#IsObservable\">IsObservable</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>)</span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage\">solutionGroupGeneratorImage</a> <span class=\"fn\">obs</span> <span class=\"fn\">obs_is_observable</span> <a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup.html#SolutionGen.J\">SolutionGen.J</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.negOneMatrixUnit\">negOneMatrixUnit</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"On the distinguished generator, the intended generator image is $-I$:\n$$\n  \\rho_0(J) = -I.\n$$\nThis rewrite lemma is used to simplify the final representation on\n`SolutionGroup.J` and in equation-relator calculations.\n","docLink":"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage_J","kind":"theorem","line":234,"name":"SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage_J","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.lean#L234-L246"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/SolutionGroup/Representation.html#SolutionGroup.solutionGroupGeneratorImage_var\"><span class=\"name\">SolutionGroup</span>.<span class=\"name\">solutionGroupGeneratorImage_var</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">S</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LinearSystem\">LinearSystem</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Defs.html#Fintype\">Fintype</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#DecidableEq\">DecidableEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">obs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\